          "depth": 4,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "Adding __builtin_prefetch for upcoming cache lines at both group and point levels reduces memory latency. Using posix_memalign to allocate xs/ys arrays on 16-byte boundaries enables faster aligned NEON loads. Replacing two separate vst1q_f32 stores with a single vst1q_f32_x2 store reduces instruction count. Adding restrict qualifiers on heap and labels pointers eliminates aliasing concerns for the compiler. These changes maintain correctness while further improving SIMD throughput.",
