              "Added __builtin_prefetch inside batch loop to prefetch two cache lines ahead",
              "Changed allocation of xs and ys in parse_next_group from malloc to posix_memalign with 16-byte alignment",
              "Replaced separate vst1q_f32 stores for each half with a single vst1q_f32_x2 store using float32x4x2_t pair",
              "Added restrict qualifier on heap and labels pointers in knn function and heap_insert_or_replace signature"
            ]
