          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "Converting from Array-of-Structs (AoS) to Struct-of-Arrays (SoA) layout with aligned allocation enables contiguous memory access for SIMD vectorization. Adding restrict qualifiers, hoisting outer loop coordinates into local variables, and applying #pragma omp simd reduction on the inner force accumulation loop allows efficient auto-vectorization while maintaining thread-level parallelism via OpenMP parallel for. Explicit prefetching hints (__builtin_prefetch) reduce cache miss latency. This combination should lower execution time below previous best results.",
